--
^warning: ignoring
--
**kwargs parameters are not supported. The kwarg field in the AST
is ignored, so kwargs is an unknown variable inside the function.
At call sites, keyword arguments that don't match positional params
are discarded. Fix: model **kwargs as a dict parameter, pack
unmatched keywords into a dict at call sites.
